1790107211174190	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEyjxA		item.comment	bn-1ybn3	{"body":"Fixed in ws bn-1ybn3: daemon/mod.rs step 7 returns replayed(): recorded outcome, request_id echoed from the retry, audit re-derived for this request (only where the recorded outcome carries audit). No extra audit write: the replay's AdmissionRecord (step 5) already carries the new correlation (RFC 0026 @audit_recorded 'every call'; RFC 0027 P5). gate_g1_03: finding_* pins flipped to regression_a_replay_echoes_the_retrys_request_id and regression_a_replay_carries_this_requests_audit_correlation (checks admission record exists); sweep/interleave/retention/refused replays compare against readdressed(). just check: pass."}	blake3:0y0MXT-m2FB6XCNSNkScwycgzsHJX4dCYrnNKmYF72w
