1790107325974507	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEykhA		item.comment	bn-2a7q9	{"body":"Fixed g2_injection_corpus_evidence.rs: is_privileged now reads notes/plan/schemas/continuumd-native-protocol.idl directly (local idl_scan module, same approach as gate_g2_07_acceptance.rs, not shared per directory convention) instead of registry::operation(name).has(Annotation::Privileged) — the table daemon::admission itself consults. Applied to: is_privileged, enforcement::landed_privileged_operations, and the coverage guard the_corpus_drives_at_every_privileged_operation_this_daemon_serves, which now names repair.promote and repair.reject explicitly as unlanded privileged operations instead of dropping them via a silent is_landed filter. Non-vacuity: applied the intent.lock Annotation::Privileged-drop mutant to registry.rs locally, reran the suite — 2 of 20 tests failed (no_case_in_the_corpus_triggers_a_privileged_operation and enforcement::the_privilege_bit_is_the_only_difference_between_admitted_and_denied) — then reverted (git diff confirms registry.rs clean, no src changes in the commit). just check: pass (fmt, clippy, tests, crate boundaries, dossier validator, lean build, axiom manifest)."}	blake3:vrLXlTXgMn28uYYa1yHVM_dvDrMzKdBwKrZhCQuJbS4
1790107340018494	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEykxA		item.comment	bn-3oocz	{"body":"Commit 434ee2b. (1) task::resume now refuses an uncatalogued model (UnsupportedSemanticFeature) after the terminal answer and before the budget write; run_in arm kept as unreachable typed fallback, commented (no race: &mut DaemonState per dispatch, catalog has no removal). (2) Unheld engine keeps ContinuationEpochMismatch: RFC 0026 resume decision table EpochUnsupported row is about epochs, P2 row covers engine, engine is not an epoch. Tests: class_model_availability_is_refused_before_any_reuse (via refused_without_trace, verified to fail without the guard); F2 test doc now a guard citing RFC 0026; negative controls re-driven by a PublicationAborted resume over an armed store fault; accounting moved PublicationAborted to PROBED. just check: pass."}	blake3:Z4SNltVH8zPXh_knk6HnGD0bj7npzDdR2RtDFXQgiZ0
1790107345388780	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEylBA		item.comment	bn-2ga1c	{"body":"context.compile now reads budget.bytes (vs pack doc bytes, via output::Ceiling::of_budget, shared with expand), output_policy.max_bytes (vs payload in negotiated encoding, output::Ceiling::of + measure) and max_nodes (vs selected[], recorded at content_budget.nodes via new RootPack.nodes). Over any ceiling: BudgetExhausted + non_resumable_reason, nothing registered (RFC 0028 guaranteed-core rule). FAULTS lists it. G2-05 pin flipped to 4 regression guards (at-limit, limit+1). just check green. Open: no root packer, so smaller-root branch not taken."}	blake3:C9rfPA6NmSp8iJMEIBoa3QAcQFfN4E34V0UGWLesODI
